[5.020398, "o", "\r\n🔧 1. Shared Infrastructure\r\n────────────────────────────\r\n\r\nProxy Client (shared/proxy_client.py):\r\n  → x402 payment flow (402 → pay USDC → proxy session)\r\n  → Mobile User-Agent rotation\r\n  → Session management\r\n\r\nData Toolkit Pipeline (shared/scraper.py):\r\n"]
[5.020559, "o", "  → deduplicate() by content hash\r\n  → filter_nulls() for clean output\r\n"]
[5.020842, "o", "  → to_json() / to_csv() export\r\n"]
